WEBVTT

00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:01.976
But that happened very -- a long time ago

00:10:02.000 --> 00:10:03.976
compared to

00:10:04.000 --> 00:10:05.976
350 short years ago.

00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:07.976
But in that 350 years,

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:10.976
the place has just undergone
a lot of changes.

00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:12.976
In fact, everybody in this room probably,

00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:15.976
especially if you picked up your bag --

00:10:16.000 --> 00:10:17.976
some of you, I know, didn't
pick up your bags --

00:10:18.000 --> 00:10:19.976
but if you picked up your bag,
everybody in this room

00:10:20.000 --> 00:10:22.239
has got in their pocket,
or back in their room,

00:10:22.263 --> 00:10:23.976
something

00:10:24.000 --> 00:10:25.976
that 350 years ago,

00:10:26.000 --> 00:10:28.000
kings would have gone to war to have.

00:10:29.000 --> 00:10:30.976
I mean, if you can think how important --